24 Mar 2023
----------

================= mOTUs database version 3.1.0 =================

This database can be used with the mOTUs tool, see:
https://github.com/motu-tool/mOTUs

In this database there are 11,915 ref-mOTUs from progenomes2
and 2,151 meta-mOTUs and 20,128 ext-mOTUs.

The NCBI taxonomy used for this project can be found in:
https://zenodo.org/record/3357977#.XUMDaJMzbOQ

If you need any additional information, please open an issue on
the github page (see below).

